# Event Flow

```text
Event
  ↓
Event Bus
  ↓
Stream Processor
  ↓
State Update
  ↓
Derived Event
  ↓
Next Intelligence Processor
```

---

# Core Event Properties

Events contain:

```text
eventId
eventType
eventVersion
timestamp
source
traceId
entityId
payload
metadata
```

---

# Reliability Model

NEXUS initially uses an at-least-once delivery model.

Consumers must therefore be idempotent.

Failed events may be retried and eventually routed to a Dead Letter Queue.

---

# Latency

